WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.168
-Every time President Trump

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.103
and his campaign
file a dumb new lawsuit

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.306
or spread a new lie
about voter fraud,

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:09.375
they quickly get batted down --
and this will shock you --

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:10.710
it's all a giant grift.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.745
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:16.482
♪♪

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.484
Well, President Trump
has now entered

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:21.787
the "flushing his weed while
the cops pound on the door"

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:23.456
stage of his presidency.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.259
Everyone who inhabits the world
of observable reality,

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.561
from a majority of Americans
to world leaders,

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.930
to even some
Republican state officials,

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.233
has accepted that Trump lost
and Joe Biden is

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.733
the president-elect
of the United States.

00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:37.703
Even some of Trump's
closest friends and allies

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:39.572
on the world stage
have abandoned him,

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.407
like British Prime Minister
Boris Johnson.

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:43.643
Not only are they close
friends and allies,

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:45.811
but they look like
estranged half brothers

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:47.981
who came
from the same sperm donor.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:49.682
And I'm guessing
that sperm donor was

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.552
[ Laughing ]
Nick Nolte's mugshot?

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.754
[ As Nolte ]
Oh, you guys are both my boys?

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:55.855
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.423
-Well, on Wednesday,
even Boris Johnson

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:58.991
called Joe Biden
the president-elect

00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:02.028
and tossed in an extra burn
on Trump for good measure.

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:04.063
-One of the many merits

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:05.297
of the excellent conversation

00:01:05.297 --> 00:01:08.667 line:0%
I had yesterday
with president-elect Joe Biden

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:11.904 line:0%
was that we strongly agreed
on the need,

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:13.572 line:0%
once again,
for the United Kingdom

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:16.909 line:0%
and the United States
to stand together.

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:19.412 line:0%
-Does the prime minister
now have any advice

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:23.782 line:0%
for his erstwhile best friend,
President Trump,

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:26.920 line:0%
whose continuing refusal
to accept the result

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.155 line:0%
is both embarrassing for him

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:31.724 line:0%
and dangerous
for American democracy?

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:32.858 line:0%
-Prime Minister.

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:35.395 line:0%
-Well, Mr. Speaker,
I had -- and have --

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:37.663 line:0%
a good relationship
with the previous president.

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.665 line:0%
I do not resile from that.

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.200 line:0%
It is the duty of all
British prime ministers

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.469 line:0%
to have a good relationship
with the White House.

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.005
-Wow! Not only did he call
Joe Biden president-elect,

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.208
he called Trump
"the previous president."

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:51.510
That's such an effortless
little English burn.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.613
The English can insult you
in such a way

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:54.747
that you can be on your deathbed

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.151
twenty years later and think,
"Hey!"

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.618
Your best friend said that?

00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:01.421
[ English accent ]
My erstwhile best friend.

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:03.556
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.891
Oh, trust me.

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:08.560
He's erstwhile, now.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.396
But as the old saying goes,
if you can't trust

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:13.065
a fellow right-wing goon
who once got stuck on a zip line

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:15.935 line:0%
and tackled a small boy
during a rugby game,

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:17.803 line:0%
[ Pounding desk ]
then who can

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:19.905
you trust?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.905 --> 00:02:22.107
That's how clear and decisive
Biden's victory was.

00:02:22.107 --> 00:02:25.144
Even Trump's closest allies
on the world stage

00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:27.446
have gone out of their way
to congratulate Joe Biden

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:29.515
and recognize his victory
in the election.

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:32.017
And they're not alone.
Several Republican officials

00:02:32.017 --> 00:02:33.252
in key swing states,

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:34.587 line:0%
from Georgia secretary of state

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.556 line:0%
to the Arizona attorney general,

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:38.424 line:0%
to the Philadelphia
city commissioner,

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:42.061
have all made clear that there
is no widespread fraud

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:45.331
and that the results in their
states are not going to change.

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.899 line:0%
-Do you have
any indication

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:49.869 line:0%
of major irregularities
or fraud in this election?

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:52.204 line:0%
-We haven't found
any widespread fraud.

00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:55.141 line:0%
-Our office received more
than 1,000 complaints shortly

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:57.243 line:0%
after the election,
dealing with bleed-throughs

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.511 line:0%
and people using Sharpies.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:00.513 line:0%
We looked into that.
We were able to determine

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:02.848 line:0%
that did not affect
anyone's vote.

00:03:02.848 --> 00:03:06.385 line:0%
They also did a random audit
of 2% of the precincts

00:03:06.385 --> 00:03:08.053 line:0%
and it came back 100%

00:03:08.053 --> 00:03:11.156 line:0%
that there wasn't any
statistical anomalies or errors.

00:03:11.156 --> 00:03:13.960 line:0%
-I have seen the most
fantastical things

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.361 line:0%
on social media,

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:19.165 line:0%
making completely
ridiculous allegations

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:22.301 line:0%
that have no basis
in fact at all.

00:03:22.301 --> 00:03:25.438
-Oh, so you also follow
the president on Twitter?

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:27.340
"I have seen the most
fantastical things"

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.842
sounds like something Dorothy
would say in "The Wizard of Oz,"

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.611
and, yet, he's accurately

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:33.813
describing the president's
Twitter account.

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:36.115
"I have seen the most
fantastical things.

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:38.150
Witches and Munchkins
and a video of the president

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.919
tackling Vince McMahon
with the CNN logo on his face."

00:03:40.919 --> 00:03:43.389
And not only are those
three Republicans,

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.324
but even Karl Rove
wrote an op-ed

00:03:45.324 --> 00:03:47.159
declaring that there is
no evidence of fraud

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:48.261
that could overturn
the election.

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:50.563
Karl Rove!
The guy who engineered

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:52.664
the last disastrous
Republican presidency

00:03:52.664 --> 00:03:53.699
to lose the popular vote.

00:03:53.699 --> 00:03:55.968
When you lose Karl Rove,

00:03:55.968 --> 00:03:59.072
you need to do some serious
lack of a soul searching.

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.906
This is like Darth Vader saying,

00:04:00.906 --> 00:04:03.276
[ Whining ]
"Guys, why are we trying
to rebuild the Death Star?

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:04.710
They're just gonna
blow it up again."

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.112
No, Darth!

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.146
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:10.550
Don't talk to yourself that way!

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:13.419
[ Dully ] "I guess I can make
a bigger one."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:14.753
And if the word
of those Republicans

00:04:14.753 --> 00:04:16.256
isn't enough for you,
The New York Times

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:18.824
called election officials
in every state

00:04:18.824 --> 00:04:21.027
and found that there is
no evidence of fraud.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:22.695
A postal worker who claimed

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:25.598
to have witnessed ballot
tampering recanted his claims

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:26.899
and said they were made up.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:28.500
Even the Trump
campaign's lawsuits

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.403
have mostly been laughed
out of court.

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:32.238
For example,
you might have heard one

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:33.505
of their most
common complaints,

00:04:33.505 --> 00:04:34.674
that their poll watchers,

00:04:34.674 --> 00:04:36.909
in states like Pennsylvania
and Michigan,

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:39.544
weren't allowed to observe
the vote counting.

00:04:39.544 --> 00:04:40.680
According to Trump...

00:04:46.018 --> 00:04:47.387
He keeps doing this thing
where he thinks

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:49.422
he can just call dibs on states,

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:53.292
the way a stoner calls dibs
on the last slice of pepperoni.

00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:55.261
"Devon, there's no pizza left.

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:58.697
That's the drawing
on the box, Devon.

00:04:58.697 --> 00:05:00.533
Devon!
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:02.267
Look, Devon!

00:05:02.267 --> 00:05:06.272
We all love weed, Devon,
but you've got to stop!"

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:07.606
[ Laughter ]

00:05:07.606 --> 00:05:09.675
Trump thinks it's official
as long as he throws in

00:05:09.675 --> 00:05:11.677
a "hereby" or a "therefore."

00:05:11.677 --> 00:05:14.213
That's the same tactic
drunk Red Sox fans use

00:05:14.213 --> 00:05:15.982
when they're getting dragged
away by cops.

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:19.084
[ Boston accent ]
I hereby claim
squatter's rights!

00:05:19.084 --> 00:05:21.687
Therefore granted to me
by the commonwealth,

00:05:21.687 --> 00:05:23.322
allowing me
to continue urinating

00:05:23.322 --> 00:05:25.257
from atop this telephone pole.

00:05:25.257 --> 00:05:27.393
But the more important thing is
it's not true.

00:05:27.393 --> 00:05:30.362
Trump lawyers have filed
a bunch of frivolous lawsuits

00:05:30.362 --> 00:05:33.366
claiming that, because they were
barred from observing the count,

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:35.668
the states shouldn't be allowed
to certify their results,

00:05:35.668 --> 00:05:37.836
which is insane because,
first of all,

00:05:37.836 --> 00:05:39.338
the ballot counting
was literally

00:05:39.338 --> 00:05:42.308 line:0%
shown live on television
for everyone to watch.

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:44.143 line:0%
I remember because I was
sitting on my couch staring

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:46.812
at cable news 24 hours a day,
four days straight,

00:05:46.812 --> 00:05:48.581
like I was
in "A Clockwork Orange."

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:49.715
I watched so much cable news,

00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:51.283
I started dressing
like Steve Kornacki.

00:05:51.283 --> 00:05:52.785
When I close my eyes,

00:05:52.785 --> 00:05:56.155
I can still see Jake Tapper's
forehead furrows.

00:05:58.057 --> 00:06:00.893
Second, Trump lawyers brought
this claim before a judge,

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:02.762
who dismissed it as absurd.

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:04.430
Here's how one case went
in Pennsylvania

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:06.865
before a judge appointed,
it should be noted,

00:06:06.865 --> 00:06:08.000
by George W. Bush...

00:06:22.815 --> 00:06:25.417
It's great that the more Trump
uses fancy courtroom words,

00:06:25.417 --> 00:06:27.920
like "hereby" and "therefore,"
the more judges start talking

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.855
like they're the ones
from Queens.

00:06:29.855 --> 00:06:31.624
"Your honor there were
a nonzero number

00:06:31.624 --> 00:06:32.958
of people in the counting room."

00:06:32.958 --> 00:06:34.227
[ Queens accent ]
Well, there's a nonzero chance

00:06:34.227 --> 00:06:35.695
I'm going to knock
your [bleep] block off,

00:06:35.695 --> 00:06:37.696
if you don't start giving me
straight answers.

00:06:37.696 --> 00:06:39.031
"Nonzero."

00:06:39.031 --> 00:06:40.333 line:0%
I believe that case
was called...

00:06:43.369 --> 00:06:45.972
And then, there's the
repeatedly debunked myth

00:06:45.972 --> 00:06:47.640
that dead people are voting.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.308
This is one of the dumbest
voter fraud lies

00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:51.109
because it almost always
turns out

00:06:51.109 --> 00:06:52.478
that it's
an administrative error

00:06:52.478 --> 00:06:53.880
or a case
of mistaken identity.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.548
You know, because sometimes

00:06:55.548 --> 00:06:57.616
multiple people
have the same name,

00:06:57.616 --> 00:06:59.685
an idea that's sure
to come as a shock

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:01.854
to Donald Trump and his son,
who's, uh --

00:07:01.854 --> 00:07:02.921
What's his name?

00:07:02.921 --> 00:07:04.389
Oh!
It's escaping me.

00:07:04.389 --> 00:07:06.592
Oh, right, Forrest Stump.

00:07:06.592 --> 00:07:08.127
Anyway, CNN did an investigation

00:07:08.127 --> 00:07:10.029
where they sampled
50 names of dead people

00:07:10.029 --> 00:07:11.831
who had supposedly voted
in Michigan.

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:13.232
Of those 50, it turns out...

00:07:22.141 --> 00:07:23.475
I think my favorite part

00:07:23.475 --> 00:07:25.744
is the five people who voted
and were still alive.

00:07:25.744 --> 00:07:28.314
It must suck to get
mistaken for dead.

00:07:28.314 --> 00:07:30.816
Rudy Giuliani, of all people,
should be able to sympathize.

00:07:30.816 --> 00:07:32.618
[ As Giuliani ]
Hey, stop throwing dirt on me.

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:35.221
Can't a guy catch a few winks
in a shallow ditch anymore?

00:07:35.221 --> 00:07:36.489
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.489 --> 00:07:38.791
Although my favorite
dumb conspiracy theory

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:40.192
has to be the existence

00:07:40.192 --> 00:07:43.429
of a mysterious Biden-Harris
van in Nevada

00:07:43.429 --> 00:07:45.764
where Democrats were supposedly
filling out mail ballots.

00:07:45.764 --> 00:07:47.867
It's a claim that has been
repeated multiple times

00:07:47.867 --> 00:07:50.002
by Trump's legal team
and Fox News.

00:07:50.002 --> 00:07:51.303 line:0%
-The poll workers
saw people

00:07:51.303 --> 00:07:52.805 line:0%
bringing handfuls
of ballots

00:07:52.805 --> 00:07:55.207 line:0%
to a Biden-Harris
campaign van.

00:07:55.207 --> 00:07:57.310 line:0%
Those ballots were then
filled out at the van,

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.945 line:0%
placed in return envelopes.

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:00.913 line:0%
-Mail-in ballots were filled out

00:08:00.913 --> 00:08:03.549 line:0%
on the side
of a Biden-Harris van.

00:08:03.549 --> 00:08:05.150 line:0%
-You saw something suspicious --

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:06.852 line:0%
we're going to get
right into it tonight --

00:08:06.852 --> 00:08:11.490 line:0%
happening on the side
of a Biden-Harris van

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:13.058 line:0%
in the parking lot

00:08:13.058 --> 00:08:14.593 line:0%
of the polling station.

00:08:14.593 --> 00:08:16.394 line:0%
-A van pulled up
at the center,

00:08:16.394 --> 00:08:18.865 line:0%
marked "Biden-Harris."

00:08:18.865 --> 00:08:20.066 line:0%
-Wow.

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:22.701 line:0%
-The doors of the van were open.

00:08:22.701 --> 00:08:25.070 line:0%
Ballots were clearly visible.

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.840 line:0%
Ballots were opened
with letter openers

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.909 line:0%
-Wow!
-and ballots were filled in

00:08:29.909 --> 00:08:31.010 line:0%
-Boom!
-and resealed

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.411 line:0%
in envelopes.
-Amazing.

00:08:32.411 --> 00:08:36.715
-Nobody gets a van so they
can do crimes outside of it.

00:08:36.715 --> 00:08:39.584
You do the crimes in the van.

00:08:39.584 --> 00:08:40.953
That's what vans are for.

00:08:40.953 --> 00:08:43.722
You're either doing
mobile pet grooming or crimes.

00:08:43.722 --> 00:08:44.890
And if it's for crimes,

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.192
you don't put your name
on the side of it.

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:49.295
You never see a van airbrushed
"Molester Mobile."

00:08:49.295 --> 00:08:52.631
[ Laughter ]

00:08:52.631 --> 00:08:53.699
Although the kids would know.

00:08:53.699 --> 00:08:55.634
I think they're going
to have candy.

00:08:55.634 --> 00:08:57.035
[ Laughter ]
And then, yesterday,

00:08:57.035 --> 00:08:59.138
Trump shared an even dumber
conspiracy theory,

00:08:59.138 --> 00:09:00.706
a video, by some random lady,

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:02.174
of election officials
in California

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:04.210
picking up mail ballots
from a dropbox,

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.479
which is perfectly
normal and legal.

00:09:06.479 --> 00:09:07.846
-I thought they
collected them all.

00:09:07.846 --> 00:09:09.015
I just want to document.

00:09:11.316 --> 00:09:14.586
Wait. But how come they
already called the state?

00:09:14.586 --> 00:09:17.723
-Because these are
mail-in ballots.

00:09:17.723 --> 00:09:20.225
-Are you guys official
election guys?

00:09:20.225 --> 00:09:21.627
-County.

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:23.829
-Where do you guys take them?

00:09:23.829 --> 00:09:26.231
-Election center.
That's it.

00:09:26.231 --> 00:09:28.200
-I'm beginning to think
a lot of these people

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.502
genuinely don't know
how mail works.

00:09:30.502 --> 00:09:33.706
[ High-pitched ]
I'm sorry, where is that white
piece of paper going?

00:09:33.706 --> 00:09:35.140
And why does it have
a little sticker

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:36.341
of an American flag on it?

00:09:36.341 --> 00:09:39.211
And why are you wearing
shorts in November?

00:09:39.211 --> 00:09:40.412
Okay.

00:09:40.412 --> 00:09:42.047
Okay. I'm just asking.

00:09:42.047 --> 00:09:43.382
And it will not shock you
to learn

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:45.284
the Trump campaign
and Republican Party's attempts

00:09:45.284 --> 00:09:47.520
to invalidate the results
of the election are,

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.890
in large part, a giant grift
with the side effect

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.258
of lighting our democracy
on fire.

00:09:52.258 --> 00:09:54.393
The Trump campaign has been
soliciting donations

00:09:54.393 --> 00:09:56.094
to pay for legal challenges

00:09:56.094 --> 00:09:58.831
to supposedly defend
the integrity of the election,

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:01.099
but, as Reuters reported,
it turns out,

00:10:01.099 --> 00:10:04.804
in the fine print,
that donations under $8,000

00:10:04.804 --> 00:10:07.506
go to the president and the
Republican National Committee.

00:10:07.506 --> 00:10:09.841
Like everything else Trump
and the GOP do,

00:10:09.841 --> 00:10:11.042
this is also a scam.

00:10:11.042 --> 00:10:12.378
The money's just going to them.

00:10:12.378 --> 00:10:13.512
When Trump finally concedes,

00:10:13.512 --> 00:10:15.147
he'll probably do it
in a Bugatti,

00:10:15.147 --> 00:10:17.249
wearing diamond-encrusted
Cartier sunglasses

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:18.951
and the necklace
from the Titanic.

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:20.185
[ As Trump ]
Thanks for all your donations,

00:10:20.185 --> 00:10:21.287
but, unfortunately,

00:10:21.287 --> 00:10:24.056
it wasn't enough
to stop the deep state.

00:10:24.056 --> 00:10:27.393
If you need me,
I'll be vacationing in Fiji.

00:10:27.393 --> 00:10:29.061
With only a few exceptions,
the Republican Party

00:10:29.061 --> 00:10:30.462
is standing in lockstep
behind Trump

00:10:30.462 --> 00:10:32.064
and perhaps his final grift
as president

00:10:32.064 --> 00:10:34.232
because they know
it will fire up his base

00:10:34.232 --> 00:10:36.068
and they don't care
what damage they do

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:37.269
to democracy in the process.

00:10:37.269 --> 00:10:38.937
Even after Trump leaves office,

00:10:38.937 --> 00:10:40.672
cynical Republicans
know Trumpism

00:10:40.672 --> 00:10:43.075
is the future of their party
and they want to maintain...

00:10:43.075 --> 00:10:45.077 line:0%
-A good relationship
with the previous president.

00:10:45.077 --> 00:10:46.812
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:10:46.812 --> 00:10:50.849
♪♪

00:10:50.849 --> 00:10:52.651
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:52.651 --> 00:10:54.019
over two million meals a year

00:10:54.019 --> 00:10:56.455
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:10:56.455 --> 00:10:58.156
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:10:58.156 --> 00:11:00.425
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:11:00.425 --> 00:11:03.429
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:03.429 --> 00:11:05.430
Stay safe.
Wash your hands.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.066
Wear a mask.
We love you.

